            "value" : "天气卡片:定位、显示与当前数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn this on while the app you want is playing. Only that app is tracked afterwards." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Actívalo mientras suena la app que quieres. Después solo se sigue esa app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你想跟随的 App 正在播放时打开它,之后只跟随这个 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses your network address, so no permission is needed. Turn it off if it picks the wrong city." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usa tu dirección de red, así que no pide permisos. Desactívalo si da una ciudad incorrecta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用你的网络地址定位,不需要权限。定位不准时关掉它。"
          }
        }
      }
